SetFees_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller not owner
│  └── it should revert
└── when caller owner
   ├── when staking fee exceeds max
   │  └── it should revert
   ├── when unstaking fee exceeds max
   │  └── it should revert
   └── when both fees within max
      ├── when fees zero
      │  └── it should set both fees to zero
      ├── when fees at max
      │  └── it should set both fees to the max
      └── when fees differ
         └── it should set each fee independently
